{"id":"1bcb881963ef","html":"<div><div><p>You are here: <span><a href=\"https://austinkleon.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Blog</span></a></span> <span aria-label=\"breadcrumb separator\">/</span> <span><a href=\"https://austinkleon.com/category/miscellany/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Miscellany</span></a></span> <span aria-label=\"breadcrumb separator\">/</span> New typewriter interviews with Adam Koford and Kevin Huizenga</p>\n<p><time datetime=\"2026-09-08T12:32:09-04:00\">Tuesday, September 8, 2026</time>  </p><div><p><img src=\"https://austinkleon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/image-2-600x766.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"766\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>My latest <a href=\"https://austinkleon.substack.com/t/typewriter-interviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">typewriter interviews</a> are with two cartoonists — one is a fully-drawn and pithy eye feast from <a href=\"https://austinkleon.substack.com/p/typewriter-interview-with-adam-koford\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Adam Koford</a>, and the other a surprisingly wordy meal from <a href=\"https://austinkleon.substack.com/p/typewriter-interview-with-kevin-huizenga\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Kevin Huizenga</a>:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://austinkleon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/image-3-600x764.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"764\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n</div></div></div>"}